1
00:01:57,079 --> 00:01:57,680
Where's Yang Qingyou?

2
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,159
He ran off.

3
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,799
I'm the only spectator left.

4
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,280
What else do you need to buy?

5
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,040
Explain it to me clearly.

6
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,840
Once and for all.

7
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,680
The 20mm rebar...

8
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,480
Why buy it in three separate batches?

9
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,400
Why did he give you the ledger?

10
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,639
Why did Dad give you the ledger?

11
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,319
Who's he guarding against?

12
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,240
Can't trust me, huh?

13
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,520
Did Wen Jiayin teach you to say that?

14
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:11,960
Never mind who taught me.

15
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,800
If she hadn't taught you,

16
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,439
you wouldn't even be able to speak, right?

17
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:14,080
Don't poke me!

18
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:14,919
Are you a parrot?

19
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,960
Do you really think the Sais have a throne to inherit?

20
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,120
Fine, even if we did,

21
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,439
do you really think you're the crown prince?

22
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:20,439
Just parroting someone else...

23
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,560
You'd be better off learning some real skills.

24
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,840
Big ambition, no real talent.

25
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,280
Fine, fine, fine.

26
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,120
You want to be emperor, right?

27
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,520
Well, let me tell you something.

28
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,680
Dad isn't dead yet!

29
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,159
You want to control the ledger, don't you?

30
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:27,479
Fine.

31
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,479
I'll set the rules for you today.

32
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:29,919
Show up to work at this time every day.

33
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:30,439
In your dreams.

34
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,639
I won't come in for a single day.

35
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:31,960
Got that?

36
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,479
Stop poking me!

37
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:33,080
Show me some respect!

38
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,960
Wherever I work,

39
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:34,759
you come wait for me there.

40
00:02:34,759 --> 00:02:35,520
Without my signature,

41
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,879
you won't get a single cent.

42
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:37,479
That's final.

43
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,120
You stay right here!

44
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:38,560
You...

45
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,400
Back off!

46
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,199
Don't get physical!

47
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,159
Calling you a parrot—

48
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,719
Stop fighting!

49
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,080
Let go! Listen to me this time!

50
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,960
Stop fighting! Stop fighting!

51
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,280
Cut it out!

52
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:50,800
Stop fighting already!

53
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,199
Blood brothers fighting each other!

54
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,000
Out of the way, move!

55
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,960
Stop fighting!

56
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,560
Let go! Get up!

57
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,280
Let go!

58
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,039
Which construction crew are you from?

59
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,080
Causing trouble here?

60
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,120
Brawling out in the open!

61
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,919
Have you no respect for the law?

62
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:04,800
Take them away! Take them away!

63
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,560
Take them away! Move it!

64
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,759
Wait, no! I was just breaking it up!

65
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,400
Breaking it up or not,

66
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,439
you can explain it to the police!

67
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,199
Move it!

68
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,080
Break it up, disperse!

69
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,439
Get in!

70
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,080
Get inside! In you go, get in!

71
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,039
Hold on, I'm not going in!

72
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:14,639
Hurry up!

73
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:15,080
Get in!

74
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,120
Do you know Sai Xiuming?

75
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,960
My oldest brother is Sai Xiuming! We're on your side!

76
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,360
Shut up!

77
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,560
Come on, let's talk! Don't lock the door!

78
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,039
Brother!

79
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:20,840
Stay put and behave!

80
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:21,840
We've already called the police.

81
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,639
Once the police get here,

82
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,560
you'll be fined per person.

83
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,360
Well, Mr. Big-Shot Lawyer...

84
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:31,520
Aren't you so capable?

85
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,840
Why don't you go reason with them?

86
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,599
In all these years,

87
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,879
this is the one decent thing you've done.

88
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:43,520
Big Bro,

89
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,919
isn't this our own construction site?

90
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:47,199
I mean, we're supposed to be the bosses,

91
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,120
so how did we end up locked up?

92
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,400
Are you kidding me?

93
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,919
Are you out of your mind?

94
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:51,560
What do we do for a living?

95
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,479
A construction crew! Get it?

96
00:03:53,759 --> 00:03:55,560
We're hired labor rolling up our sleeves!

97
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,319
Do you understand?

98
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,800
Who made you a boss?

99
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,719
On this site,

100
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,039
there are clients,

101
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,919
chief engineers, and project managers!

102
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,080
Even the cafeteria lady

103
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,080
and the girl at the snack shop

104
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,240
throw their weight around more than us!

105
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,479
On this job site,

106
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,960
there are seven or eight crews!

107
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,439
You finish the job, take your money, and get lost!

108
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,719
Did you really think this place, these buildings,

109
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,759
belonged to us?

110
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,759
Unbelievable.

111
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,759
Your big brother has to

112
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,000
grovel like a dog on this turf every single day!

113
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,680
Like I'm some big shot!

114
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,639
You knew you had no power,

115
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,240
yet you still threw hands?

116
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,120
And you!

117
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,040
I couldn't hold you back at all!

118
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,160
And then me, the guy trying to break it up,

119
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,720
gets locked in here too!

120
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,759
It's fine, Third Bro.

121
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,560
Don't worry.

122
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,480
These security guards have no enforcement authority.

123
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,240
What is this called?

124
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,800
This is unlawful detention!

125
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,160
Calling the cops won't help us!

126
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,199
Our college boy speaks!

127
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,839
Unlawful detention, huh?

128
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,199
So what if they locked you up?

129
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,759
What will the police say when they get here?

130
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,959
They'll say we were brawling!

131
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,720
If nothing else,

132
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:37,639
the project manager

133
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,560
will slap us with a 30,000-yuan fine first!

134
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,680
Are you going to pay for it then?

135
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,480
Cut the nonsense.

136
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:43,279
Either way,

137
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,160
they can't illegally lock us up in here!

138
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,959
Before you threw a punch,

139
00:04:46,279 --> 00:04:47,240
you should've had the cash ready!

140
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,079
Enough!

141
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,279
Stop arguing!

142
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,240
Figure out a way

143
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:53,759
to get out of here.

144
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,040
How are we supposed to get out?

145
00:04:59,600 --> 00:04:59,920
Take this.

146
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,319
Isn't this breaking the law?

147
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,480
Stop hitting! Stop hitting!

148
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,680
Stop! Don't hit!

149
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,560
Pick the lock!

150
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,879
Stop fighting! Stop fighting!

151
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,600
Stop it!

152
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,319
Let me go!

153
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,240
Let's go, let's go!

154
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:18,560
Move!

155
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:18,920
This way!

156
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,360
Which way?

157
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:19,920
Over here, over here!

158
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Run, run! Quick!

159
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:21,759
After them!

160
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:24,759
Hurry, Third Bro!

161
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:25,199
Stop!

162
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:25,759
Freeze!

163
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,160
Run!

164
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,160
Third Bro, run!

165
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,439
Don't run! Stop right there!

166
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:30,079
Run faster, they're chasing us!

167
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,319
Stop! Stop!

168
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:31,920
Halt!

169
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,199
I'm talking to you! Don't run!

170
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,240
Stop right there!

171
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:34,839
Shut the door!

172
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,079
Close it! Shut the door!

173
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,360
Hold it! Hold it!

174
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,360
Hold it shut!

175
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,439
Quick, hold it tight!

176
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:40,600
Go, go, run!

177
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,240
They're blocking the door!

178
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,839
They got away!

179
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,480
I'm telling you,

180
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,800
ever since we were kids, being with you two

181
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,560
always meant trouble!

182
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Save your breath!

183
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,800
Just run!

184
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,360
This way!

185
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,439
Run this way!

186
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,160
Get inside!

187
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,319
Hurry up, Third Bro!

188
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,399
I can't.

189
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:39,800
They didn't catch up, right?

190
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,560
Whatever.

191
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,000
Tell me,

192
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,720
that security guard back there...

193
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,040
If he were a bit chubbier,

194
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,319
wouldn't he look just like Dad

195
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:51,160
chasing the three of us with a stick?

196
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,560
Just like when we were kids.

197
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,120
I swear,

198
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,079
you two are my bad luck charm.

199
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,240
Nonsense!

200
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,120
Whenever you two got into trouble back then,

201
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:04,480
wasn't I always the first to get beaten?

202
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,079
Give me a break.

203
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,959
You two did all the bad stuff,

204
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,040
but I was always the one getting chewed out!

205
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,600
What? Me?

206
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,839
When I went to your parent-teacher conferences,

207
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:11,839
did I get yelled at any less?

208
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:12,759
Seriously!

209
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:13,959
All right, enough.

210
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,759
I really can't run anymore.

211
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,360
How about this?

212
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,519
Let's go back

213
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,759
and own up to it.

214
00:07:20,759 --> 00:07:21,040
Right.

215
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,000
My...

216
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:23,720
my car is still over there.

217
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,199
Wait, hold on—

218
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:26,079
We can't go back!

219
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,639
Going back means a fine.

220
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,519
How about this?

221
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,240
You each give me 5,000,

222
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,240
and I'll go back

223
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,399
to take the fall for you both.

224
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,600
I'll fetch your car,

225
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,480
and you'll save face.

226
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,319
How's that?

227
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:37,240
Let me tell you,

228
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,399
if you want money, forget it.

229
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,959
If you want my life, take it!

230
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:41,480
Laughing? Only you could laugh!

231
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,160
Picking on me again!

232
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,000
You would find this funny!

233
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,279
So do you have the money or not?

234
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:44,800
You too!

235
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,199
You two are ganging up on me again, huh?

236
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,120
My back...

237
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,439
My back! My back!

238
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:54,839
I can't get up!

239
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:57,240
My leg's cramping! A cramp!

240
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:58,839
It's cramping up!

241
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:27,639
All done?

242
00:08:28,279 --> 00:08:28,920
I'll clear the table, then.

243
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,679
I told you to keep it down.

244
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:41,320
The upstairs neighbors

245
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,519
have complained about you so many times!

246
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,039
What's wrong?

247
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:43,440
Jiaqi,

248
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:44,039
it's only eight.

249
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,960
Listen to Auntie.

250
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,519
Keep it down.

251
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:48,600
You're so annoying!

252
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,279
Can't you understand me?

253
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:52,919
I told you to turn it down!

254
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:53,960
Give it back to me!

255
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,759
Give it to me!

256
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,519
Give it here!

257
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:55,879
Stop pinching!

258
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,879
Stop hitting! Stop it!

259
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:01,039
Okay, okay, okay!

260
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:02,240
Stop fighting!

261
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,480
Jiaqi, you hit me!

262
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,320
Why are you hitting me?!

263
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,000
Move! Let me teach her a lesson!

264
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:08,879
Don't hit her!

265
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,519
Qianjin, she doesn't know any better.

266
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,159
If you get into a fight,

267
00:09:12,159 --> 00:09:13,080
you're being just as childish!

268
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,559
Who are you calling childish?!

269
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,559
She scratched me!

270
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,759
Let me tell you,

271
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,279
either she leaves this house today,

272
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,120
or I do!

273
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:22,159
Choose!

274
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:23,360
Are you kicking her out or not?!

275
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,639
Qianjin...

276
00:09:27,279 --> 00:09:27,720
Don't...

277
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,480
Fine!

278
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,480
You're family, right?

279
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,720
Then I'm getting out of here!

280
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,360
Can you be quiet?!

281
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:45,159
Apologize to Auntie right now!

282
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:47,320
Qianjin!

283
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,240
Qianjin, Qianjin, don't leave!

284
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:50,120
Where are you going?

285
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,559
Don't go, please! I'm begging you!

286
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:52,240
Let go!

287
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,440
Qianjin, Qianjin, you can't leave!

288
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,159
Let go of me!

289
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:55,360
I'll apologize for her!

290
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:55,759
Okay?

291
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,519
No need to apologize.

292
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:57,559
I can't take it.

293
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,080
No, no, no!

294
00:09:58,159 --> 00:09:58,799
She isn't like

295
00:09:58,799 --> 00:09:59,600
the kids around here.

296
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,480
She's a foreigner!

297
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,320
She really doesn't know the rules!

298
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:02,960
Please, I'm begging you!

299
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,480
Don't go, all right?

300
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,080
Jin Jingran,

301
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:05,639
we're over.

302
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:07,279
Wait, Qianjin! Qianjin!

303
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,440
Does it hurt?

304
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:36,159
Does it hurt?

305
00:10:36,559 --> 00:10:37,799
You... what do you think?

306
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:39,600
Good, it should hurt.

307
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:40,960
It'll teach you a lesson.

308
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,840
You're a grown man, still getting into fights.

309
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:44,600
If Dad finds out about this,

310
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,600
lying there in his hospital bed,

311
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,320
he'll be mortified.

312
00:10:46,399 --> 00:10:47,919
If anyone should be ashamed, it's me.

313
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,320
What does it have to do with you?

314
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:50,440
Look,

315
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,960
how are you going to face Xiuliang from now on?

316
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,360
You're bound to run into each other all the time.

317
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:55,679
Once Dad gets out of the hospital

318
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:57,159
and sees how you two brothers are acting,

319
00:10:57,399 --> 00:10:58,639
how will you explain this to him?

320
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,279
Let me tell you, Xiuming,

321
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,320
about the construction site:

322
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,440
Xiuliang knows nothing about it.

323
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:03,440
He doesn't have a clue.

324
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,720
You tell him to sign,

325
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,440
and he just signs.

326
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,759
If anything goes wrong,

327
00:11:06,879 --> 00:11:08,480
he'll insist it was his big brother's idea.

328
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,840
When Dad comes home from the hospital

329
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,080
and sees that mess of accounts,

330
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:13,240
won't you be the one on the hook?

331
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:14,879
We'll end up taking the fall in the end.

332
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:15,679
Alright, alright, that's enough!

333
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,320
Stop nagging!

334
00:11:16,679 --> 00:11:17,879
You talk like it's all so simple.

335
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,039
If you're so capable, get the ledger back yourself.

336
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:19,720
Don't let him manage it.

337
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:21,159
We beat each other black and blue,

338
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:22,679
and I can't get it back. Big Brother, Sister-in-law!

339
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,600
I'm home!

340
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,559
Why is she back?

341
00:11:26,559 --> 00:11:27,080
She has a key.

342
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,840
Why wouldn't she come back?

343
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,840
I'm starving.

344
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,279
Could you make me something to eat?

345
00:11:30,559 --> 00:11:31,399
Thanks!

346
00:11:33,679 --> 00:11:34,720
Why is she carrying luggage?

347
00:11:36,799 --> 00:11:37,639
What's she doing back here?

348
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:39,399
Let me tell you right now,

349
00:11:39,399 --> 00:11:40,039
I'm not waiting on her hand and foot.

350
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:42,000
Looking after one person at the hospital

351
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:42,720
is exhausting enough.

352
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,879
And now I have to wait on her, too?

353
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,360
If you want to feed her, do it yourself!

354
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,440
You Sai family folks are nothing but drama.

355
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:48,919
I might as well just work myself to death!

356
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,279
Come in.

357
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:01,840
Big Brother.

358
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:02,879
Come on in, come on.

359
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,519
We don't have...

360
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,559
much at home.

361
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:09,440
Your... your sister-in-law said

362
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:10,519
she'd make you a bowl of noodles.

363
00:12:10,879 --> 00:12:11,759
Just make do with that for now.

364
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:12,720
Come on, sit down.

365
00:12:14,279 --> 00:12:15,240
What happened to your face?

366
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:16,360
My face?

367
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,960
Oh, that...

368
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,159
At the construction site,

369
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:21,159
accidents happen.

370
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:21,919
Go on, eat up.

371
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:22,960
Eat while it's hot.

372
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,440
Careful, now.

373
00:12:26,919 --> 00:12:27,759
Thanks, Bro.

374
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,600
Jin Jingran...

375
00:12:32,159 --> 00:12:33,200
I called him.

376
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,000
What did he say?

377
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,320
What else could he say?

378
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,799
He asked me to talk some sense into you.

379
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,440
Did you chew him out?

380
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,039
Me?

381
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,440
Did you chew him out on the phone or not?

382
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:51,240
Chew him out? That...

383
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:53,039
That wouldn't be right, me chewing him out.

384
00:12:53,039 --> 00:12:54,159
What's not right about it?

385
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:55,440
You're my big brother!

386
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,320
Can't you tell him off for me?

387
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:56,960
What's wrong with that?

388
00:12:58,039 --> 00:12:59,879
Do you know how he treated me?

389
00:13:00,279 --> 00:13:01,240
How did he treat you?

390
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,600
Look at this!

391
00:13:02,799 --> 00:13:03,120
This...

392
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,360
Who scratched you like this?

393
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,440
His daughter, that's who!

394
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:08,039
Just over the remote control,

395
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:10,039
she kicked me and pulled my hair!

396
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:11,919
She nearly ripped my scalp off!

397
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,519
It hurt so bad!

398
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:14,480
All right, all right.

399
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:15,279
Okay, okay, that's enough.

400
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,080
That's enough. Look...

401
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:17,720
I can't live like this anymore.

402
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,120
I want a divorce!

403
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,720
Divorce... You shouldn't say that lightly.

404
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,080
People... well,

405
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:26,159
everyone can get hot-headed.

406
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:28,360
What kind of man Jin Jingran is...

407
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:30,120
don't you know better than any of us?

408
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:31,440
Just... just think about it.

409
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,279
Think about all the good things he's done.

410
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:34,919
Back then,

411
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,000
when he was pursuing you,

412
00:13:36,279 --> 00:13:37,360
look how hard he tried.

413
00:13:37,519 --> 00:13:39,720
He came running to our place all the time.

414
00:13:40,759 --> 00:13:41,720
Bringing food,

415
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:42,720
bringing gifts...

416
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,600
After buttering up Dad,

417
00:13:44,879 --> 00:13:45,960
he buttered us up too.

418
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:46,879
He knew full well

419
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:50,039
Xiuhe and I were the hardest to win over.

420
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,360
Didn't he rush over to our house

421
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:52,360
right after work

422
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,279
just to drink with us?

423
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,840
He threw up every single time.

424
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,200
Then he'd grab my legs

425
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:56,679
and beg me,

426
00:13:56,840 --> 00:14:00,200
"Brother, I truly love Qianjin!

427
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,799
I adore Qianjin!

428
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:04,480
Please entrust Qianjin to me!

429
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:07,679
I swear I'll treat Qianjin right my whole life."

430
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,120
Didn't he say that?

431
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:10,559
Sure,

432
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,320
Jin Jingran

433
00:14:13,519 --> 00:14:14,159
was being a jerk.

434
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,919
But I bet... I'd guess

435
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:19,720
he's caught in the middle too,

436
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,120
and hasn't figured things out yet either.

437
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:23,080
Look,

438
00:14:23,639 --> 00:14:26,519
on one hand, the one he's owed for years,

439
00:14:26,879 --> 00:14:27,919
his biological daughter,

440
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,159
and on the other, you, whom he loves so much.

441
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:31,639
So tell me,

442
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,320
what do you expect him to do?

443
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,039
Besides,

444
00:14:35,399 --> 00:14:36,480
married couples

445
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:38,000
inevitably fight sometimes.

446
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,879
Even your sister-in-law and I,

447
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,399
we fight all the time, right?

448
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,279
When tempers flare,

449
00:14:42,519 --> 00:14:43,919
I've slapped her a few times too, haven't I?

450
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:47,799
All right.

451
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,320
Just stay home

452
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,399
for a couple of days.

453
00:14:50,879 --> 00:14:51,639
Cool off first,

454
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,000
and let Jin Jingran

455
00:14:53,879 --> 00:14:54,600
process things.

456
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:55,559
I'm sure

457
00:14:55,879 --> 00:14:57,080
once he figures it out,

458
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:59,480
he'll come here to apologize

459
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,600
and make amends.

460
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:03,000
Eat your noodles.

461
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:03,919
They'll get clumped up soon.

462
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,279
See? What did I say?

463
00:15:08,639 --> 00:15:09,240
They're all clumped together now.

464
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:10,080
Give them a stir.

465
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,200
Tell the driver

466
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,799
to get their helmets on properly.

467
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:33,080
Put your helmet on.

468
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:34,879
How many times do I have to tell you?

469
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:35,960
Bro.

470
00:15:36,519 --> 00:15:37,639
Jiao, put your helmet on.

471
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,200
All right, get to work.

472
00:15:39,879 --> 00:15:40,399
Put it on!

473
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:43,759
Let's go.

474
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:46,159
What's wrong?

475
00:15:49,039 --> 00:15:49,360
Nothing.

476
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,519
Things not going well at the site?

477
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,480
Or did Biaozi pick on you?

478
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,200
No.

479
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,399
Then what's going on?

480
00:15:57,919 --> 00:16:00,600
The clinic sent out a notice last night.

481
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,679
They said our village is being demolished,

482
00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:05,279
so the clinic will be shut down too.

483
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:08,200
I went to ask about future plans,

484
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,519
and they said all staff will be laid off.

485
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,039
Since I'm a contract worker,

486
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,039
all I get is severance,

487
00:16:15,039 --> 00:16:16,000
and I have to find a new job myself.

488
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:17,879
Yeah.

489
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:19,320
Jobs these days...

490
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:20,919
...aren't easy to find.

491
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:22,759
I could find one,

492
00:16:23,039 --> 00:16:24,120
but it'd be far from home,

493
00:16:25,519 --> 00:16:26,639
and hard to look after my dad.

494
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,720
It's okay, Bro.

495
00:16:31,639 --> 00:16:33,279
Things will work themselves out.

496
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:34,559
Let's go.

497
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,879
Why don't you have dinner with us first?

498
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:52,879
No, it's fine.

499
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,200
You still have to take care of your dad at home.

500
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,000
The construction site is exhausting enough.

501
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:55,799
Hurry on back.

502
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,519
Alright, I'll get going then.

503
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:08,039
What are you looking for?

504
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,359
My earring.

505
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:11,119
One of my earrings fell off.

506
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,079
An earring fell off?

507
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,720
Brother, check inside my hat for me.

508
00:17:14,759 --> 00:17:15,599
In... In the hat?

509
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:16,920
Nothing here.

510
00:17:17,279 --> 00:17:17,799
Nope, nothing.

511
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,079
Did it fall in the car?

512
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:19,960
Definitely.

513
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,839
I was still wearing it when I got in.

514
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:22,920
Still wearing it when you got in...

515
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,680
My mom gave it to me.

516
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,960
It's part of my dowry.

517
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,759
Did you leave it at the site?

518
00:17:26,759 --> 00:17:27,599
No way.

519
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,839
I was wearing it when I got in.

520
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:29,400
Let me check.

521
00:17:32,039 --> 00:17:32,480
Here, let me.

522
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,279
Come on.

523
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,440
Step aside, out of the way.

524
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:36,319
Don't worry.

525
00:17:36,799 --> 00:17:37,319
It's definitely in the crack.

526
00:17:37,319 --> 00:17:37,920
I'll help you look.

527
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:38,519
Let me check underneath there.

528
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,440
I'll take this apart.

529
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:42,680
Don't worry, take it easy.

530
00:17:42,839 --> 00:17:44,200
Let me see if it's over here.

531
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,640
Brother Xiuming.

532
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:46,720
Stop looking.

533
00:17:48,519 --> 00:17:50,079
Maybe I really did leave it at the site.

534
00:17:50,839 --> 00:17:51,400
It's fine.

535
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:52,640
Don't bother.

536
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:54,839
Thank you, though.

537
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:37,720
Dad.

538
00:18:39,039 --> 00:18:39,400
Dad.

539
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,240
You're up and walking around.

540
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,440
Sit down and rest a bit.

541
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,039
Can't do that.

542
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:43,960
He has to walk even if it hurts.

543
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,880
Otherwise he'll get adhesions.

544
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,680
Besides, his legs are swollen too.

545
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:47,599
Pressing down leaves a dent.

546
00:18:47,599 --> 00:18:48,440
He has to keep moving.

547
00:18:48,759 --> 00:18:49,279
All right, all right.

548
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,599
Then... hang in there a bit.

549
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:51,960
I'll take it, I'll take it.

550
00:18:52,279 --> 00:18:52,680
Let me hold it.

551
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:54,680
You've got some internal heat lately.

552
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:56,480
You should drink more water.

553
00:18:58,720 --> 00:18:59,640
That's impressive.

554
00:19:00,559 --> 00:19:01,799
Sorted right out

555
00:19:02,319 --> 00:19:03,279
in just one go.

556
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:05,240
Careful.

557
00:19:08,599 --> 00:19:09,480
What happened to your face?

558
00:19:11,039 --> 00:19:11,480
Driving.

559
00:19:11,839 --> 00:19:12,960
Hit the brakes too hard.

560
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:13,720
Got bumped.

561
00:19:13,799 --> 00:19:14,279
It's nothing.

562
00:19:16,599 --> 00:19:18,240
Everything's fine at the site.

563
00:19:21,119 --> 00:19:21,680
Everything's good.

564
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:22,799
Work's going on as usual.

565
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,519
If anything comes up,

566
00:19:25,359 --> 00:19:26,319
talk to your big brother

567
00:19:27,039 --> 00:19:28,000
and discuss it properly.

568
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:30,480
Don't worry.

569
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,039
We brothers are getting along great.

570
00:19:32,559 --> 00:19:33,839
He guides me on every big issue.

571
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,839
After all these days,

572
00:19:36,119 --> 00:19:38,079
do you know the crew well now?

573
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:39,720
Got them all figured out.

574
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,359
To be honest,

575
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:42,960
with you away from the site,

576
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,359
my brother's actually running it quite well.

577
00:19:49,039 --> 00:19:50,440
Has the Phase 3 payment come in?

578
00:19:52,079 --> 00:19:52,799
Not yet.

579
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:54,839
Then...

580
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:57,440
is there enough money in the account?

581
00:20:00,039 --> 00:20:00,559
It's enough.

582
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,960
There's really enough.

583
00:20:06,880 --> 00:20:07,440
Really, it's enough.

584
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:15,559
Dad, watch it—

585
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:17,920
Slow down, slow down, slow down.

586
00:20:18,599 --> 00:20:19,119
Excuse me.

587
00:20:20,079 --> 00:20:20,960
Walk a bit slower.

588
00:20:21,759 --> 00:20:23,279
If I don't hold you, you'll fall again.

589
00:20:53,119 --> 00:20:54,680
Where did you put the ID and the business license?!

590
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:56,119
I've already made a deal with Yang Er!

591
00:20:56,359 --> 00:20:57,880
He can take over our construction crew today!

592
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,599
Splitting up the family wasn't enough for you?!

593
00:21:01,759 --> 00:21:03,880
That was built by me, your Uncle Xizi, and Uncle Wei!

594
00:21:04,039 --> 00:21:06,319
It's the family business we built up from scratch!

595
00:21:06,359 --> 00:21:07,039
Family business?

596
00:21:07,359 --> 00:21:08,440
It's losing money every single day!

597
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:09,480
This "family business" of yours...

598
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,720
...has nearly wiped out everything we have!

599
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:12,039
How did I raise such a...

600
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:13,720
...cold-blooded, heartless bastard?!

601
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:16,519
What did I do to deserve this?!

602
00:21:16,519 --> 00:21:17,519
You're hitting me now?!

603
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:18,559
Ma Laibu!

604
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,079
What are you doing?!

605
00:21:20,599 --> 00:21:20,960
Dad!

606
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,680
The ID and the business license...

607
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:24,319
...do you know where they are?!

608
00:21:24,319 --> 00:21:25,039
You insolent bastard!

609
00:21:25,039 --> 00:21:25,480
What are you—

610
00:21:25,599 --> 00:21:26,559
Get the hell out of here!

611
00:21:26,559 --> 00:21:27,000
Get out!

612
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:27,519
What are you doing?!

613
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:28,720
I'm telling you—

614
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:29,240
Just get out!

615
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:30,880
You dare hit me again?!

616
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:33,000
Don't think I don't know what you're scheming!

617
00:21:33,079 --> 00:21:33,759
You bastard!

618
00:21:33,759 --> 00:21:34,920
Sai Duoxi is just feeding you empty promises!

619
00:21:35,079 --> 00:21:35,640
You fool!

620
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,319
Get out!

621
00:21:36,559 --> 00:21:38,200
As long as I have a breath left in me,

622
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:40,960
nobody touches my construction crew!

623
00:21:45,799 --> 00:21:46,240
Laibu!

624
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,160
Don't move! Don't move!

625
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,880
Don't you move!

626
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,160
Don't move!

627
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:52,920
Bastard!

628
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:07,799
You...

629
00:22:09,319 --> 00:22:09,799
Aren't you...

630
00:22:13,519 --> 00:22:14,559
You disgrace!

631
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:17,799
What a disgrace!

632
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:22,079
You disgrace!

633
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:26,400
Dad.

634
00:22:27,279 --> 00:22:28,960
I made all your favorites today.

635
00:22:29,559 --> 00:22:31,519
I went light on the oil and salt.

636
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:32,200
Here.

637
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:38,839
What's wrong, Dad?

638
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:40,240
No appetite?

639
00:22:42,359 --> 00:22:42,960
Not feeling well?

640
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:44,799
I'll go get the doctor.

641
00:22:50,039 --> 00:22:51,640
Has the phase three payment come through?

642
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,240
The books...

643
00:22:55,799 --> 00:22:57,039
Xiuliang handles all of that.

644
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,599
I'm not really sure.

645
00:22:58,839 --> 00:22:59,920
You really don't know?

646
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:01,759
I really don't.

647
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,880
Have the workers been paid yet?

648
00:23:05,119 --> 00:23:06,279
This month's materials,

649
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,440
were they bought on credit?

650
00:23:17,559 --> 00:23:17,960
Fine.

651
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:19,960
You don't know?

652
00:23:20,599 --> 00:23:21,480
I'll ask the eldest.

653
00:23:21,759 --> 00:23:22,799
Call the eldest over.

654
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:24,480
Go on.

655
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:25,559
Dad,

656
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:28,359
we really didn't mean to keep you in the dark.

657
00:23:28,799 --> 00:23:30,880
Didn't you just have surgery?

658
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:32,920
We were worried that if you found out,

659
00:23:33,039 --> 00:23:34,000
you'd get anxious

660
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,599
and ruin your health.

661
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:36,759
Don't worry,

662
00:23:37,559 --> 00:23:38,680
the two brothers

663
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:40,160
can handle it.

664
00:23:41,559 --> 00:23:42,480
Handle it how?

665
00:23:45,079 --> 00:23:46,680
The third-phase payment isn't in,

666
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:48,799
workers' wages can't be paid,

667
00:23:50,039 --> 00:23:51,400
and material deliveries are stalled.

668
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:52,920
If this affects the quality,

669
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,160
who's going to take the blame?

670
00:24:05,119 --> 00:24:06,160
Did the second son tell you that?

671
00:24:10,759 --> 00:24:12,000
Whatever the issue is,

672
00:24:12,279 --> 00:24:13,839
can't you sit down and talk it through?

673
00:24:14,599 --> 00:24:15,559
It's not that we don't care,

674
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:17,279
or that we refuse to help.

675
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:19,240
It's all the family business,

676
00:24:19,759 --> 00:24:21,200
so of course we want to help.

677
00:24:21,839 --> 00:24:23,119
But the second son is set in his ways,

678
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,759
and won't listen to a thing we say.

679
00:24:27,599 --> 00:24:28,559
We're anxious too!

680
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,000
In this construction team,

681
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,799
Xiuming is the one holding things up.

682
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,839
Covered in dirt and mud every day,

683
00:24:34,319 --> 00:24:35,599
he's not just looking after our site,

684
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:36,720
he has to watch the Ma family's too.

685
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,799
Even so,

686
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:39,319
buying a single piece of rebar

687
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:40,359
or a box of nails

688
00:24:40,359 --> 00:24:41,160
needs the second son's approval;

689
00:24:41,160 --> 00:24:42,400
we have to apply through him for everything.

690
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:44,720
How are we supposed to get work done?

691
00:24:45,759 --> 00:24:47,039
He brought it up to you first,

692
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:49,720
otherwise I wouldn't have said anything.

693
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:52,400
This kind of thing

694
00:24:54,119 --> 00:24:54,880
is just hard to talk about.

695
00:24:58,119 --> 00:24:58,799
Zhenzhu's mom,

696
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:02,440
since we're on the subject,

697
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:05,359
let me be completely frank with you.

698
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,559
Before my surgery,

699
00:25:08,119 --> 00:25:09,799
why did I set things up like this?

700
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,480
The second son

701
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:12,759
is educated.

702
00:25:13,079 --> 00:25:14,519
He understands contracts

703
00:25:15,119 --> 00:25:16,359
and knows how to manage accounts.

704
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,240
He can ensure

705
00:25:18,359 --> 00:25:19,680
that this construction team

706
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,039
doesn't fall into traps.

707
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,160
As for the eldest,

708
00:25:24,119 --> 00:25:25,680
he knows how to lead the workers

709
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:29,480
and understands the worksite.

710
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:31,440
They're like a person's

711
00:25:31,559 --> 00:25:32,920
left and right hands.

712
00:25:33,359 --> 00:25:35,160
Only when they work together

713
00:25:36,319 --> 00:25:37,559
do they become a pair of hands

714
00:25:38,319 --> 00:25:40,599
that work, feed the family, and make money.

715
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:46,440
As the old saying goes,

716
00:25:47,279 --> 00:25:49,079
An elder sister-in-law is like a mother.

717
00:25:49,599 --> 00:25:50,920
You've been in this family

718
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,400
for so many years now.

719
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:55,079
Keeping peace between the brothers,

720
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,599
isn't that your job as their sister-in-law?

721
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,519
With the two of them like this now,

722
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:01,279
as their sister-in-law,

723
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:04,799
shouldn't you step in and mediate?

724
00:26:05,039 --> 00:26:06,640
Get them to work together properly,

725
00:26:07,039 --> 00:26:09,480
and find a way to solve the problem.

726
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:11,720
Am I right?

727
00:26:12,559 --> 00:26:14,200
Think about it carefully yourself.

728
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:39,960
Hello.

729
00:26:40,039 --> 00:26:40,440
Hello.

730
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:43,279
A friend recommended your shop.

731
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,799
They said you sell those...

732
00:26:44,799 --> 00:26:46,200
the old-style... you know...

733
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:47,559
What do you call them?

734
00:26:47,559 --> 00:26:48,039
Earrings?

735
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:48,839
Yes, exactly.

736
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:49,440
I—

737
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,759
What style are you looking for?

738
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,799
Well, the kind that's...

739
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,799
an older style, fairly wide.

740
00:26:54,799 --> 00:26:55,200
Do you have any?

741
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,960
Let me check for you.

742
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,920
We don't have many vintage styles.

743
00:27:03,039 --> 00:27:03,839
Take a look.

744
00:27:03,839 --> 00:27:04,559
Is it like this?

745
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:07,960
This looks... somewhat similar.

746
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,839
Do you have anything...

747
00:27:10,279 --> 00:27:11,799
a bit narrower than this,

748
00:27:11,799 --> 00:27:12,920
and maybe slightly smaller?

749
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:13,359
Anything like that?

750
00:27:13,799 --> 00:27:14,799
Actually, there is one.

751
00:27:14,839 --> 00:27:16,359
Give me a moment, I'll find it for you.

752
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:19,440
Take a look.

753
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,440
We have this one as well.

754
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:21,319
Yes!

755
00:27:21,759 --> 00:27:22,759
Right, right, right!

756
00:27:23,079 --> 00:27:23,559
This is the one.

757
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:24,839
Could I ask you something?

758
00:27:24,839 --> 00:27:26,720
My friend only lost one earring,

759
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:27,839
so I only want to buy a single one.

760
00:27:27,839 --> 00:27:28,240
Would that be okay?

761
00:27:28,799 --> 00:27:29,680
I'm sorry, sir.

762
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:31,240
We only sell them in pairs.

763
00:27:31,519 --> 00:27:32,079
If you want to buy them,

764
00:27:32,079 --> 00:27:33,000
you have to get the whole pair.

765
00:27:33,279 --> 00:27:35,119
Would you like to think about it?

766
00:27:38,799 --> 00:27:39,160
All right.

767
00:27:39,559 --> 00:27:41,039
Just wrap them up for me.

768
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:42,720
Sure thing, I'll wrap them right up.

769
00:28:02,799 --> 00:28:04,200
Hello, who are you looking for?

770
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:06,559
I'm looking for your boss.

771
00:28:07,599 --> 00:28:08,480
We don't have a boss here.

772
00:28:09,599 --> 00:28:10,680
Sai Xiuliang isn't here?

773
00:28:11,039 --> 00:28:11,880
Oh, you're looking for Lawyer Sai.

774
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:13,680
Lawyer Sai.

775
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:14,720
Print this document.

776
00:28:14,799 --> 00:28:15,200
Sure thing.

777
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:16,400
Someone's here to see you.

778
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:20,680
I'm busy.

779
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:21,240
Hold on a second.

780
00:28:21,799 --> 00:28:22,319
This way, please.

781
00:28:24,279 --> 00:28:24,759
Look at this.

782
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,720
Are these figures correct?

783
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:34,880
Thanks.

784
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:35,720
Please wait a moment.

785
00:29:09,119 --> 00:29:09,440
Alright.

786
00:29:33,960 --> 00:29:34,839
Ashamed of me, are you?

787
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,440
Your place looks quite fancy.

788
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:45,359
So many people, too.

789
00:29:47,119 --> 00:29:47,960
Must keep you busy.

790
00:29:48,519 --> 00:29:49,720
A wolf in sheep's clothing.

791
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:51,920
Out with it. What trap are you digging for me now?

792
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,400
Why so angry?

793
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:57,799
Can't I just come visit?

794
00:29:58,039 --> 00:29:58,440
Sure you can.

795
00:29:58,880 --> 00:29:59,920
Take a look at my face first.

796
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:01,680
Then you'll know

797
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:02,880
why I'm so angry.

798
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:04,559
You two...

799
00:30:04,559 --> 00:30:05,039
are really something.

800
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,759
Scheming against me at every turn.

801
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:10,160
Having Yang Qingyou drag me

802
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:11,359
for every trivial little thing

803
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,799
all the way to the site just to sign papers.

804
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:13,839
Do I know anything about it?

805
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:14,640
Let me ask you:

806
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,400
Do I know anything about it?

807
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:16,400
If something goes wrong,

808
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:17,240
who's taking the blame?

809
00:30:17,359 --> 00:30:18,839
Listen to yourself.

810
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:21,559
Aren't we doing this for the team's own good?

811
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:22,240
Xiuliang,

812
00:30:22,599 --> 00:30:23,880
things getting this bad between you and your brother...

813
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,039
It breaks my heart, too.

814
00:30:25,799 --> 00:30:27,160
Dad just scolded me,

815
00:30:27,359 --> 00:30:28,799
saying as the elder sister-in-law,

816
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:29,799
I failed to keep the family together.

817
00:30:30,039 --> 00:30:31,079
So I was thinking,

818
00:30:32,119 --> 00:30:33,920
how about we do what you suggested earlier?

819
00:30:34,519 --> 00:30:35,720
Any expense under twenty thousand,

820
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:37,160
we won't bother you about it.

821
00:30:37,279 --> 00:30:38,240
We'll handle it ourselves.

822
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,079
For amounts over twenty thousand,

823
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:41,440
we'll give you a call.

824
00:30:41,759 --> 00:30:43,240
You can decide whether to authorize it

825
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,680
or come over in person.

826
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:47,119
Seeing your big law firm just now,

827
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:49,680
you must have so many major cases waiting every day.

828
00:30:50,119 --> 00:30:51,920
The team's matters are just trifles—

829
00:30:52,279 --> 00:30:53,759
payroll slips,

830
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,519
purchase approvals, and such.

831
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:57,400
Distracting you with all of this

832
00:30:57,799 --> 00:30:59,160
will only keep you from your real work.

833
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:00,680
Look,

834
00:31:01,519 --> 00:31:02,720
this isn't the old man's hospital room.

835
00:31:03,759 --> 00:31:04,359
Drop the act.

836
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,200
Whatever you want,

837
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:06,880
just say it straight.

838
00:31:10,319 --> 00:31:11,440
Hand over the account books.

839
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:14,039
Your brother and I will look after them for you.

840
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:15,839
If Dad asks,

841
00:31:16,359 --> 00:31:17,400
we'll cover for you

842
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:19,480
and tell him you still have them.

843
00:31:20,039 --> 00:31:21,640
That saves trouble for everyone.

844
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:24,240
I don't think that's wise.

845
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,799
Dad entrusted the account books to me.

846
00:31:27,359 --> 00:31:28,680
What if something goes wrong?

847
00:31:28,839 --> 00:31:29,880
Who can take the blame?

848
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:32,039
Forget it. Besides, it's not that much work.

849
00:31:32,519 --> 00:31:33,160
I won't trouble you two.

850
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:34,000
What blame would you take?

851
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:37,359
How many times a month do you even visit the site?

852
00:31:37,359 --> 00:31:38,640
The rebar delivered last week

853
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,960
still hasn't been approved for payment!

854
00:31:40,079 --> 00:31:41,519
If the project schedule gets delayed,

855
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:42,880
can you take responsibility for that?

856
00:31:43,359 --> 00:31:44,559
Didn't you two say

857
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:46,079
the proper procedures

858
00:31:46,359 --> 00:31:47,599
must still be followed?

859
00:31:47,599 --> 00:31:48,200
Xiuliang,

860
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,839
let me be completely honest with you.

861
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:52,359
With the construction team in its current state,

862
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:53,839
if anything goes wrong,

863
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:55,400
you are responsible,

864
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:57,200
but Dad favors you most.

865
00:31:57,559 --> 00:31:58,880
He wouldn't have the heart to say a harsh word to you.

866
00:31:59,200 --> 00:31:59,880
In the end, the scapegoats

867
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:00,880
will still be your brother and me.

868
00:32:01,359 --> 00:32:02,599
Yes, we made things difficult for you on purpose.

869
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:03,799
It was my idea.

870
00:32:04,160 --> 00:32:05,759
But we're heartbroken!

871
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:08,400
Your brother has worked himself to the bone for that site,

872
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,319
yet in the end,

873
00:32:09,319 --> 00:32:10,400
Dad hands his life's work over to you—

874
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:11,559
someone who doesn't even know

875
00:32:11,559 --> 00:32:12,319
which way the site's front gate opens.

876
00:32:12,799 --> 00:32:13,960
Isn't that, in front of the whole family,

877
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:15,119
slapping your brother and me across the face?

878
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:17,359
So our work for over a decade meant nothing?

879
00:32:17,839 --> 00:32:18,640
We're just thieves,

880
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:20,240
and we're not worthy of trust!

881
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:22,440
We just wanted to see you screw up,

882
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:23,799
so Dad could see

883
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:26,319
who truly cares about the team,

884
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:28,720
and who's truly capable of running it.

885
00:32:30,039 --> 00:32:30,440
Just take it.

886
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:35,960
If you'd just handed it over earlier,

887
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:37,759
everything would've been fine.

888
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:41,519
Besides, something like this...

889
00:32:41,839 --> 00:32:43,079
You wouldn't understand it anyway, right?

890
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,680
With your big brother and me watching over it,

891
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,480
you can rest easy.

892
00:32:55,559 --> 00:32:55,920
Wait,

893
00:32:56,519 --> 00:32:56,960
on the books,

894
00:32:59,119 --> 00:33:00,279
there isn't even 20,000 yuan left.

895
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,160
Didn't we just agree?

896
00:33:05,839 --> 00:33:06,960
Anything under 20,000 yuan,

897
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:07,759
you guys handle it.

898
00:33:09,559 --> 00:33:09,920
No, but—

899
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:12,200
we can't even pay wages this month!

900
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:20,519
You're busy. Sorry to bother you.

901
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:21,000
Stop right there.

902
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:23,559
Something you asked for—

903
00:33:23,559 --> 00:33:24,559
can you just give it back?

904
00:33:24,559 --> 00:33:25,240
Does that make any sense?

905
00:33:25,759 --> 00:33:26,519
No, but look at the books!

906
00:33:26,519 --> 00:33:27,960
Sit down and listen to me.

907
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:29,319
Let me explain this to you.

908
00:33:29,759 --> 00:33:30,799
Hear me out and see if it makes sense.

909
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,640
I've told you more than once.

910
00:33:34,079 --> 00:33:35,240
All this family drama,

911
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:36,319
I don't want any part of it.

912
00:33:37,119 --> 00:33:39,079
This construction team will be yours sooner or later.

913
00:33:39,599 --> 00:33:40,160
Taking it over now

914
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:42,799
is better than inheriting an even worse mess later.

915
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,680
At least you can prepare for it now.

916
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:46,519
The Phase 3 payment hasn't come in yet,

917
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:48,759
but I'll find a way.

918
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,680
I'll talk to Uncle Wei and Tengyue again.

919
00:33:51,079 --> 00:33:53,599
Let's work together to do right by the old man.

920
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:34,480
Laijiao.

921
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:39,960
Xiuming.

922
00:34:42,559 --> 00:34:44,119
What... What happened to your place?

923
00:34:44,519 --> 00:34:44,920
What's going on?

924
00:34:46,639 --> 00:34:47,280
It's nothing.

925
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,559
What brings you here?

926
00:34:53,159 --> 00:34:53,559
Look.

927
00:34:54,159 --> 00:34:54,639
This...

928
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:56,480
You dropped this in my car.

929
00:34:57,159 --> 00:34:57,960
In a tiny crack.

930
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:58,920
I... I found it for you.

931
00:34:59,039 --> 00:34:59,599
Put it away safely.

932
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:02,639
Here, let me help you clean up.

933
00:35:24,599 --> 00:35:25,119
What's wrong?

934
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:27,400
Bro.

935
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,840
Our construction team...

936
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:32,440
...we can't keep it.

937
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:41,000
It's raining outside,

938
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:41,880
so we're handing out money inside!

939
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:42,719
Hurry up!

940
00:35:43,199 --> 00:35:44,599
Come collect all your wages!

941
00:35:45,599 --> 00:35:46,679
What the Mas won't pay,

942
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:47,400
I'll pay!

943
00:35:48,679 --> 00:35:49,599
Whoever wants to stay,

944
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:50,639
after taking your money,

945
00:35:50,840 --> 00:35:51,840
check in with us too!

946
00:35:52,159 --> 00:35:53,039
This construction team,

947
00:35:53,039 --> 00:35:53,679
I'm taking it over!

948
00:35:58,559 --> 00:35:59,599
No—no need to doubt it!

949
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,159
Hurry up and take your pay!

950
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:02,039
I'm right here!

951
00:36:02,039 --> 00:36:02,599
What are you afraid of?

952
00:36:02,800 --> 00:36:03,960
I speak for my dad!

953
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:04,559
Got that?

954
00:36:05,079 --> 00:36:06,400
Just take your cash without worrying!

955
00:36:06,519 --> 00:36:07,840
Take your pay! Take your pay! Take your pay!

956
00:36:11,599 --> 00:36:12,079
What are you doing?

957
00:36:14,920 --> 00:36:15,440
Ma Laibu!

958
00:36:16,639 --> 00:36:17,400
What do you think you're doing?

959
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,440
What do you mean, what am I doing?

960
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:20,440
Sai Xiuming, what do you want?

961
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:21,320
Yeah!

962
00:36:22,159 --> 00:36:22,880
You...

963
00:36:24,079 --> 00:36:24,760
Workers of the Ma family,

964
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:25,800
let me say this once more!

965
00:36:26,119 --> 00:36:28,320
The site is officially transferred to Second Uncle Yang!

966
00:36:28,639 --> 00:36:29,719
Cash in hand today!

967
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:30,679
Hurry up and take your pay!

968
00:36:31,039 --> 00:36:31,639
Don't move! Don't move!

969
00:36:31,639 --> 00:36:32,679
Nobody move! Don't move!

970
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:33,480
Nobody move! Sit down!

971
00:36:34,159 --> 00:36:36,320
Who said you could transfer the project on your own?

972
00:36:36,960 --> 00:36:37,880
I can't pay their wages!

973
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:38,400
What about it?

974
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:39,599
Besides,

975
00:36:39,599 --> 00:36:41,800
what does our site have to do with you?

976
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:42,559
Seriously!

977
00:36:42,679 --> 00:36:43,920
Listen up, all of you!

978
00:36:43,960 --> 00:36:45,239
Without his dad's word today,

979
00:36:45,239 --> 00:36:47,039
no one is allowed to take anyone else's money!

980
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,159
Not a single person moves!

981
00:36:48,199 --> 00:36:50,159
Right now, this site still belongs to the Mas!

982
00:36:50,280 --> 00:36:51,079
Nobody touches a cent!

983
00:36:51,159 --> 00:36:51,760
Did you hear me?

984
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:52,280
Sai Xiuming!

985
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:53,679
What does this have to do with you?

986
00:36:53,679 --> 00:36:54,559
How does it not?

987
00:36:55,159 --> 00:36:55,960
Their family's business

988
00:36:55,960 --> 00:36:56,920
is our family's business!

989
00:36:57,039 --> 00:36:57,840
Sai Xiuming!

990
00:36:59,320 --> 00:37:00,119
You good-for-nothing coward!

991
00:37:00,119 --> 00:37:00,760
Who are you calling that?

992
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:01,760
You! What about it?

993
00:37:01,960 --> 00:37:02,440
Without your dad,

994
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:03,440
you're not worth a damn thing!

995
00:37:03,519 --> 00:37:04,880
You really think you're somebody, don't you?

996
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:05,519
Say that again!

997
00:37:05,519 --> 00:37:06,280
I'll say it again!

998
00:37:06,719 --> 00:37:07,280
On your family's construction site,

999
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,039
do you have any say?

1000
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:09,119
Without your brother Sai Xiuliang,

1001
00:37:09,159 --> 00:37:10,480
can you pull out a single dime?

1002
00:37:10,559 --> 00:37:11,039
Get out of my way!

1003
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:12,199
You get out of my way!

1004
00:37:12,199 --> 00:37:12,920
Touch me, I dare you!

1005
00:37:13,039 --> 00:37:13,920
You touch me! Just try it!

1006
00:37:14,159 --> 00:37:14,840
I'm telling you!

1007
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:15,880
If you want to transfer it today,

1008
00:37:15,880 --> 00:37:16,920
it'll be over my dead body!

1009
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:17,880
It's a done deal!

1010
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:19,400
Don't fight!

1011
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:21,760
Get off!

1012
00:37:25,559 --> 00:37:26,559
Stop fighting!

1013
00:37:27,159 --> 00:37:28,320
Stop fighting! Stop it!

1014
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:30,079
Stop fighting! Stop it!

1015
00:37:30,079 --> 00:37:31,320
Try sticking your nose into my business again!

1016
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:36,480
Oh, my god!

1017
00:37:36,719 --> 00:37:38,400
Xiuming! Laibu!

1018
00:37:38,599 --> 00:37:39,639
Stop fighting!

1019
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,320
Stop fighting!

1020
00:37:51,559 --> 00:37:53,320
Xiuming, stop it now!

1021
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:54,599
You're gonna kill him!

1022
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:56,239
Bro, let go!

1023
00:37:57,119 --> 00:37:58,159
Bro, stop hitting him!

1024
00:37:58,320 --> 00:37:59,119
Let go!

1025
00:37:59,679 --> 00:38:00,480
Let go!

1026
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:02,480
Third Bro!

1027
00:38:03,039 --> 00:38:03,679
Get up!

1028
00:38:04,400 --> 00:38:05,239
Get up!

1029
00:38:06,039 --> 00:38:07,039
Get the hell out!

1030
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:09,039
Sai Xiuming had gone crazy.

1031
00:38:10,159 --> 00:38:11,199
But he didn't care.

1032
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:14,159
Caught for years between his father,

1033
00:38:14,599 --> 00:38:15,280
his brother,

1034
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:17,440
and the fights with his wife,

1035
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:19,679
he should've lost it long ago.

1036
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,400
At this very moment,

1037
00:38:23,360 --> 00:38:24,519
they had all vanished.

1038
00:38:25,679 --> 00:38:28,599
Only he and his fists remained.

1039
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:31,000
He finally felt

1040
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:33,800
like a man again.

1041
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:43,639
Your head...

1042
00:38:44,519 --> 00:38:45,159
How'd you get hurt?

1043
00:38:51,719 --> 00:38:52,440
Cold, aren't you?

1044
00:38:55,199 --> 00:38:55,960
Wipe it with this first.

1045
00:38:56,559 --> 00:38:57,199
Wipe it. Come here.

1046
00:38:57,559 --> 00:38:58,119
Wipe it off first.

1047
00:39:02,079 --> 00:39:02,440
Here.

1048
00:39:03,039 --> 00:39:03,800
Put on my jacket.

1049
00:39:05,679 --> 00:39:06,039
Here.

1050
00:39:07,199 --> 00:39:07,559
Come on.

1051
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:09,679
Put my jacket on first.

1052
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:20,840
Brother,

1053
00:39:23,559 --> 00:39:24,360
What's this?

1054
00:39:33,199 --> 00:39:33,760
This...

1055
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:21,280
It's our family's construction site.

1056
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:22,480
Whether we sell it or not,

1057
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:24,280
shouldn't our own family have the final say?

1058
00:41:24,599 --> 00:41:24,920
Look,

1059
00:41:25,039 --> 00:41:26,119
it's fine if you hit me,

1060
00:41:26,400 --> 00:41:26,800
right?

1061
00:41:27,079 --> 00:41:28,719
What right does Sai Xiuming have to hit me?

1062
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:30,440
Mark my words today.

1063
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:31,719
Our construction site

1064
00:41:31,719 --> 00:41:32,760
is going under soon!

1065
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,920
Before Yang Er catches on to what's going on,

1066
00:41:35,039 --> 00:41:36,199
we've got to sell it fast!

1067
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,440
If we wait, it'll be too late,

1068
00:41:37,559 --> 00:41:39,079
and we'll be stuck holding the bag!

1069
00:41:39,079 --> 00:41:40,159
All right, that's enough, Ma Laibu.

1070
00:41:40,760 --> 00:41:41,400
You're soaking wet.

1071
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:42,119
Go take a shower now.

1072
00:41:42,119 --> 00:41:42,800
I'll talk to your dad.

1073
00:41:53,559 --> 00:41:54,079
Brother-in-law,

1074
00:41:55,599 --> 00:41:56,760
Now that this has happened,

1075
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:57,880
let me say one more thing.

1076
00:41:58,840 --> 00:42:00,199
Laibu might be a bit of a jerk,

1077
00:42:00,199 --> 00:42:01,639
but his thinking is right.

1078
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:03,559
Just think about it.

1079
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,559
With your health as it is,

1080
00:42:06,119 --> 00:42:07,119
and with Laijiao's future ahead,

1081
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,400
we need to have some peaceful days.

1082
00:42:10,199 --> 00:42:11,280
We can't compare to the Sais.

1083
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:11,960
Who do the Sais have?

1084
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,639
Sai Xiuming... His brother runs the construction crew.

1085
00:42:13,639 --> 00:42:14,960
We really have no one to rely on.

1086
00:42:16,079 --> 00:42:16,719
Uncle Ma!

1087
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:18,480
Who is it?

1088
00:42:20,239 --> 00:42:20,880
Uncle Ma!

1089
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:21,760
Coming!

1090
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:26,159
Is Uncle Ma home?

1091
00:42:26,480 --> 00:42:27,960
Is that Xiuliang?

1092
00:42:28,519 --> 00:42:28,960
Uncle Ma.

1093
00:42:29,639 --> 00:42:30,480
There's a guest here.

1094
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:32,480
Hao Zhihua.

1095
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:33,719
Ma Laibu's aunt.

1096
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:34,480
Sai Xiuliang.

1097
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:35,320
Come on in.

1098
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:39,079
Word has already gotten around.

1099
00:42:40,440 --> 00:42:41,960
Yang Qingyou was worried things would blow up,

1100
00:42:42,159 --> 00:42:43,079
so he came specifically to tell me.

1101
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:45,119
I'm just here on Sai Xiuming's behalf

1102
00:42:45,119 --> 00:42:46,119
to apologize to Ma Laibu.

1103
00:42:46,360 --> 00:42:48,039
You can't blame Xiuming for this.

1104
00:42:48,559 --> 00:42:50,239
Subcontracting the project privately...

1105
00:42:50,239 --> 00:42:52,360
Th-That's against the law to begin with!

1106
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:54,079
If not for your older brother today,

1107
00:42:54,199 --> 00:42:55,880
who knows what kind of mess he'd have caused!

1108
00:43:00,679 --> 00:43:02,159
R-Right now, family matters

1109
00:43:02,159 --> 00:43:03,119
are all discussed with her.

1110
00:43:03,239 --> 00:43:04,599
J-Just say whatever you have to say.

1111
00:43:06,559 --> 00:43:06,920
Well...

1112
00:43:07,599 --> 00:43:08,440
I wanted to let you know

1113
00:43:08,440 --> 00:43:09,119
that account book,

1114
00:43:09,840 --> 00:43:10,880
I gave it to my older brother and the guys.

1115
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:21,360
Do you have some kind of grudge

1116
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:22,360
against that Shi Yongnian?

1117
00:43:23,559 --> 00:43:24,039
If there's something,

1118
00:43:24,039 --> 00:43:25,280
you can just tell me.

1119
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:27,400
He keeps trying to kick us out,

1120
00:43:27,639 --> 00:43:28,840
and now you're telling me to pull out too.

1121
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:30,079
Something must be going on.

1122
00:43:30,280 --> 00:43:31,039
Just tell me, please.

1123
00:43:31,960 --> 00:43:34,159
If I could just meet a man like that,

1124
00:43:34,519 --> 00:43:35,920
as long as he didn't hit me,

1125
00:43:36,199 --> 00:43:37,440
it'd be fine even if he made no money.

1126
00:43:37,679 --> 00:43:38,320
Something's off with you.

1127
00:43:39,639 --> 00:43:40,320
What's off with me?

1128
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:42,239
Everything about you is off.

1129
00:43:43,239 --> 00:43:44,400
What did I do that's so off?

1130
00:43:44,599 --> 00:43:45,719
Are you seeing someone?
